---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Data Security at SM Global Accounting Services"
  description="GDPR-compliant and built so client data never leaves your own systems — how we keep your practice's data secure."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Data Security</p>
      <h1>Your Data, Handled With Care</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Your client data is sensitive — every process we run is built around keeping it inside your
        own systems, not ours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>How Your Data Stays Safe</h2>
      <div class="grid grid--2" style="margin-top: var(--space-3);">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Nothing leaves your system</h3>
          <p>We access your practice's own software remotely, over encrypted connections. Files are never copied, downloaded, or moved to a third-party platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Security You Can Rely On</h3>
          <p>Firewalls, anti-virus, and IP-restricted access on every system we use to connect to yours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Our People</h3>
          <p>Every team member signs a confidentiality agreement, and we maintain a dedicated IT &amp; Data Security Lead responsible for our security infrastructure and protocols.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>GDPR, Done Properly</h3>
          <p>Our processes are built around full GDPR compliance, covering how data is accessed, transferred, retained, and deleted.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="placeholder-note" style="margin-top: var(--space-3);">
        A few claims from the original draft — specific physical-office security measures (biometric
        access, disabled USB ports) and an exact encryption standard — are left out here until they're
        confirmed as accurate for our current setup. Don't publish a security claim we can't stand behind.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <CtaBand headline="Questions About How We Handle Your Data?" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
